%% Auth: password reset by SMS (OTP) - no stored text
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant A as Auth (Frappe)
  participant J as Post-commit job
  participant OAN as OAN API
  U->>A: forgot password (phone)
  A->>A: issue OTP: pbkdf2 hash, TTL 600 s,<br/>delivery_id = new UUID4
  A->>J: enqueue after commit (code only in job args)
  A-->>U: same silent response as today
  J->>OAN: POST /messages/sms (otp, expires_at = issued + TTL,<br/>key = delivery_id, source_reference = auth:password-reset:<id>)
  OAN->>U: SMS "482913 is your password reset code..."
  U->>A: code + new password (verification unchanged)
